Package: cdtr
Title: Constrained Delaunay Triangulation with Refinement
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Michael", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Leica Geosystems Technology AB", role = "cph",
           comment = "Copyright holder of the bundled 'CDT' C++ library"),
    person(family = "CDT Contributors", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "'CDT' C++ library, https://github.com/artem-ogre/CDT"),
    person("William C.", "Lenthe", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Robust geometric predicates (predicates.h)")
  )
Description: Binding to the 'CDT' header-only C++ library: constrained and
    conforming Delaunay triangulation, Ruppert refinement by area or minimum
    angle (Ruppert (1995) <doi:10.1006/jagm.1995.1021>), resolution of crossing
    constraints, and topological region depth per triangle. Aimed at replacing
    'RTriangle' in 'anglr'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
LinkingTo: cpp11
